{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>וְאִישׁ לֹא יְדָעָהּ.</b> It is far-fetched that Scripture would speak of an unnatural act; rather, the meaning is that it is possible for the girl to be a virgin and a man lie with her and she even conceive, and it is not proper to disclose matters of sexual immorality."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:45:35.969503942Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}